docs {
  # Admin - List Reports (Filtered & Paginated)

  **Method:** `GET`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/admin/reports`
  **Auth:** Required (Admin Access Token)

  ## Description
  Retrieves a comprehensive paginated list of reports across the platform with dynamic filtering capabilities for administration.

  ## Request

  ### Headers
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |

  ### Query Parameters
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `page` | `integer` | No | Page number (default: `1`) |
  | `limit` | `integer` | No | Items per page (default: `20`, max `100`) |
  | `status` | `string` | No | Filter by status (`PENDING`, `UNDER_REVIEW`, `RESOLVED`, `REJECTED`, `DISMISSED`) |
  | `reason` | `string` | No | Filter by reason (`SPAM`, `HARASSMENT`, etc.) |
  | `reporter_user_id` | `int64` | No | Filter by reporter user ID |
  | `reported_user_id` | `int64` | No | Filter by reported user ID |
  | `reported_group_id` | `int64` | No | Filter by reported group ID |
  | `search` | `string` | No | Text search across description and response |
  | `order_by` | `string` | No | Sort column (`created_at`, `id`, `status`, `reason`, `updated_at`) |
  | `order_desc` | `boolean` | No | Sort order (default: `true`) |

  ## Response
  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [],
      "total": 0,
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 20,
      "total_pages": 0
    }
  }
  ```
  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Invalid filter or pagination parameters
  * `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or invalid token
  * `403 Forbidden` — Insufficient permissions (requires ADMIN role)
}
